 "remarks": "Set on one lushly landscaped acre in North Stamford, this striking four-bedroom contemporary pairs dramatic architecture with exceptional indoor-outdoor living. The light-filled, open interior features 9-foot-plus ceilings, expansive windows, hardwood floors, built-ins and two gas fireplaces. A sleek kitchen with gas cooking flows into spacious living and dining areas overlooking the surrounding greenery. Upstairs, the primary suite and three additional bedrooms provide a quiet separation from the home's entertaining spaces. The fully finished, heated and cooled walkout lower level is a destination of its own, featuring a custom bar, wine cellar, fireplace, built-in entertainment center and direct access to the grounds. Outside, multiple terraces and patios unfold across the hilltop setting, culminating in a hot tub framed by natural stone and a cascading waterfall-an unforgettable backdrop for both lively gatherings and peaceful evenings. Smart-home features, built-in audio, central air, tankless hot water, a generator and an attached two-car garage complete this distinctive cul-de-sac property.",
